Es algo sexual.

416
00:27:06,780 --> 00:27:08,180
Para el sexo oral.

417
00:27:08,750 --> 00:27:09,780
Vincenzo.

418
00:27:10,850 --> 00:27:12,090
Entra a mi despacho.

419
00:27:18,830 --> 00:27:20,130
Esta es la Panda,

420
00:27:20,360 --> 00:27:21,960
